{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmedla9j35k0","created":1792977817444,"text":"心血管系统疾病"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3tkt12bk0","created":1793153376118,"text":"  动脉粥样硬化\nAtherosclerosis","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3uf2lqbk0","created":1793153442001,"text":"概念","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3v6h2unc0","created":1793153501649,"text":"是一种与血脂异常及血管壁成分改变有关\n的动脉疾病，主要累及大中动脉。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3y2h00oo0","created":1793153728030,"text":"基本病变是动脉内膜脂质沉积，内膜灶状纤维化，\n粥样斑块形成，致管壁变硬，管腔狭窄，\n并引起一系列继发性病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ya4untc0","created":1793153744710,"text":"分开理解：粥样和硬化两个症状","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3yjr45i80","created":1793153765647,"text":"动脉硬化\nArteriosclerosis","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3yun65vs0","created":1793153789353,"text":"指动脉壁增厚、失去弹性、硬化性的一类疾病。","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ugh1gz40","created":1793153445051,"text":"病因","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3zfr46eo0","created":1793153835304,"text":"确切病因不清楚","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3zkoszqg0","created":1793153846048,"text":"危险因素","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg3zq1e8ao0","created":1793153857693,"text":"不可控因素","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg4000460o0","created":1793153879384,"text":"年龄：中老年\n性别：男＞女\n遗传因素","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg4097cco00","created":1793153899412,"text":"可控因素","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmg40e1xk600","created":1793153909968,"text":"高血压\n吸烟\n糖尿病\n代谢综合征","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg410ntcds0","created":1793153959181,"text":"高脂血症","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgffobbjsw0","created":1793186139975,"text":"指血浆中甘油三酯和（或）总胆固醇、低密度脂蛋白胆\n固醇升高，以及高密度脂蛋白胆固醇降低。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfg12fy5c0","created":1793186167737,"text":"LDL","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfgk5ptf40","created":1793186209294,"text":"肝脏→组织、细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfgqh9xi00","created":1793186223053,"text":"高风险因子","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfgwjdnwg0","created":1793186236241,"text":"氧化LDL(ox-LDL)是最重要的致粥样硬化因子","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfgzzq9140","created":1793186243760,"text":"促进巨噬细胞形成泡沫细胞","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfh1p2cwg0","created":1793186247469,"text":"HDL","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfh5q8ysg0","created":1793186256249,"text":"组织、细胞→肝脏","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfh5q9ygg0","created":1793186256249,"text":"胆固醇逆向转运机制","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfh5q9obs0","created":1793186256249,"text":"抗氧化作用","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ui4saeo0","created":1793153448663,"text":"发病机制","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfhfqiprc0","created":1793186278032,"text":"损伤应答学说","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfhk87mfk0","created":1793186287809,"text":"损伤因素","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfhnv3ai80","created":1793186295722,"text":"高脂血症","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfhrdljds0","created":1793186303372,"text":"机体应答","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfhug89140","created":1793186310061,"text":"单核-巨噬细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfhx6tjy00","created":1793186316023,"text":"平滑肌细胞","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfqtg0l9s0","created":1793187013149,"text":"过程","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfqyx5ixc0","created":1793187025069,"text":"内皮损伤起始","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfr2jv4m80","created":1793187032973,"text":"**单核细胞招募**：受损内皮释放趋化因子，吸\n引血液里的**单核细胞**黏附、穿越内皮，迁移到内皮下","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfr940cj40","created":1793187047252,"text":"单核→巨噬细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfrbhcz1c0","created":1793187052412,"text":"吞噬脂质，形成泡沫细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfrdsl3yo0","created":1793187057445,"text":"平滑肌细胞（SMC）来源泡沫细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfrh9tpww0","created":1793187065018,"text":"大量泡沫细胞聚集，就是早期**脂纹**","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfrlcr8hc0","created":1793187073902,"text":"泡沫细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfrq4v84o0","created":1793187084309,"text":"是吞噬了脂质的巨噬细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfrwupa5s0","created":1793187098932,"text":"是AS病理改变的基础","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ujidnc00","created":1793153451662,"text":"病理变化","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#73a1bf","color":"#ff0000","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/72f148c19d19b8402c38584b54ad8198/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":131,"height":200}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfsb7wajk0","created":1793187130204,"text":"    脂纹\nFatty Streak","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfsqsojcw0","created":1793187164113,"text":"大体观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfsybkzm80","created":1793187180493,"text":"早期病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgft0fxjzc0","created":1793187185110,"text":"斑点或条纹样","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgft685xzs0","created":1793187197701,"text":"平坦或隆起","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgftjlatuw0","created":1793187226793,"text":"镜下观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgftmxbv540","created":1793187234051,"text":"内皮下层出现泡沫细胞","note":"泡沫细胞：就是巨噬细胞吞噬了脂质，但这些脂类物质在病理的制片过程中，二甲苯、酒精等有机溶剂溶解，所以在切片上皮呈现出空泡样的外观。正常人也会出现少量的脂质沉积，但巨噬细胞可以将其清除，处于动态平衡中。\n","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfuewhhso0","created":1793187294950,"text":"脂纹期是可逆性病变","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfuk20r9k0","created":1793187306168,"text":"AS的早期病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfunw21zs0","created":1793187314515,"text":"可逆性病变","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfuuzlzsg0","created":1793187329967,"text":"纤维斑块","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfv0xdsy80","created":1793187342893,"text":"大体观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfv373o540","created":1793187347835,"text":"不规则隆起","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfv5abgp40","created":1793187352383,"text":"淡黄色—瓷白色","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfv9q6fk80","created":1793187362049,"text":"斑块可融合","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfvg77qco0","created":1793187376140,"text":"镜下观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfwayyvtk0","created":1793187443121,"text":"表层为大量胶原纤维、散在的平滑肌细胞、\n少数弹性纤维及蛋白聚糖等形成的纤维帽","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfx711gs80","created":1793187512903,"text":"纤维帽下方：泡沫细胞、SMC、ECM、炎细胞","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfxpeps6w0","created":1793187552912,"text":"                 粥样斑块/粥瘤\nAtheromatous Plaque/Atheroma","font-weight":"bold","color":"#ff0000","background":"#73a1bf","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfyk3x8kw0","created":1793187619740,"text":"AS的典型病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfyqfzgdc0","created":1793187633530,"text":"大体观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgfyuvtqrk0","created":1793187643195,"text":"大小不等","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfywrouyg0","created":1793187647299,"text":"灰黄色斑块","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfz0uld0o0","created":1793187656181,"text":"切面间黄色粥糜样物质","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg1uwwurk0","created":1793187878353,"text":"镜下观","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg2d7bvt40","created":1793187918165,"text":"玻璃样变的纤维帽","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg2lg4f400","created":1793187936111,"text":"纤维帽深部：大量无定形物质—脂质及\n坏死物，可见胆固醇结晶，有时见钙化","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg3thb3dc0","created":1793188031961,"text":"底部及周边部：可见肉芽组织、少量泡沫细胞、淋巴细胞浸润","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg4bdkq200","created":1793188070918,"text":"粥瘤处中膜平滑肌受压萎缩变薄，弹性纤维破坏，血管硬化","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggheg2xc00","created":1793189096334,"text":"分为稳定斑块和不稳定斑块","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgghth8oxc0","created":1793189129056,"text":"稳定斑块：纤维帽后而脂质池较小","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggi6w43nc0","created":1793189158253,"text":"不稳定斑块：纤维帽薄而脂质池较大，易破裂而导致\n继发血栓形成或斑块内出血，使血管急性闭塞而导致急性心肌梗死","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgfzgt9wfs0","created":1793187690930,"text":"他汀类药物不仅可以降脂，最重要可以稳定斑块","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg6hrsvg00","created":1793188241567,"text":"三期比较","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg6neuen40","created":1793188253844,"text":"脂纹期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg6z7eam80","created":1793188279515,"text":"形态特征","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg7mk4l4g0","created":1793188330351,"text":"平坦或微隆起于内膜的黄色点状/条纹状病变，肉眼可见","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg725ow280","created":1793188285942,"text":"组成成分","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg7rmxslk0","created":1793188341405,"text":"平坦或微隆起于内膜的黄色点状/条纹状病变，肉眼可见","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg73txsk00","created":1793188289585,"text":"病理变化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg7vuam680","created":1793188350557,"text":"内皮损伤，脂质浸润内膜下，巨噬细胞吞噬脂质形成泡沫细胞","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg758ely80","created":1793188292637,"text":"临床意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg807clvc0","created":1793188360053,"text":"可逆性病变，无症状，需干预防止进展","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg76p7yhk0","created":1793188295830,"text":"转归","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg83a19kw0","created":1793188366746,"text":"通过控制危险因素（如血脂、血压）可消退","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg6ot9i740","created":1793188256893,"text":"纤维斑块期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg6z7eam80","created":1793188279515,"text":"形态特征","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg86bnstc0","created":1793188373375,"text":"灰黄色或瓷白色隆起斑块，边界清晰，表面覆盖纤维帽","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg725ow280","created":1793188285942,"text":"组成成分","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8aoxih40","created":1793188382884,"text":"纤维帽（胶原纤维、平滑肌细胞）、脂质核心、少量炎性细胞","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg73txsk00","created":1793188289585,"text":"病理变化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8dz87mg0","created":1793188390037,"text":"平滑肌细胞增生并分泌胶原，形成纤维帽覆盖脂质核心，中膜受压变薄","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg758ely80","created":1793188292637,"text":"临床意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8ify99k0","created":1793188399756,"text":"血管狭窄（＜50%），可能引起缺血症状（如心绞痛）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg76p7yhk0","created":1793188295830,"text":"转归","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8lkmrw00","created":1793188406569,"text":"持续进展或稳定，需药物（如他汀）延缓斑块发展","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg6s5c5tk0","created":1793188264153,"text":"粥样斑块期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg6z7eam80","created":1793188279515,"text":"形态特征","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8r3pgo00","created":1793188418606,"text":"明显隆起的灰黄色斑块，纤维帽下含脂质核心，表面可钙化或溃疡","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg725ow280","created":1793188285942,"text":"组成成分","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8uoq46o0","created":1793188426407,"text":"纤维帽变薄或破裂，脂质核心扩大，含坏死崩解物、胆固醇结晶","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg73txsk00","created":1793188289585,"text":"病理变化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg8y3csm80","created":1793188433822,"text":"斑块内出血、钙化、溃疡，可合并血栓形成，中膜萎缩甚至断裂","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg758ely80","created":1793188292637,"text":"临床意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg90v4ndc0","created":1793188439855,"text":"易损斑块，纤维帽破裂后诱发急性血栓（心肌梗死、脑卒中）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmgg76p7yhk0","created":1793188295830,"text":"转归","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgg93u0l1c0","created":1793188446318,"text":"不可逆，需抗血小板治疗（如阿司匹林）或介入手术（支架）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggjnd97kw0","created":1793189272482,"text":"继发性病变","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggnhu21ag0","created":1793189573894,"text":"斑块内出血","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggnk2nvpc0","created":1793189578768,"text":"破裂、栓塞、血栓形成\n（斑块破裂，粥样物质进入血管腔，\n导致血栓的形成，引起血管腔的狭\n窄甚至闭塞）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggoeugbt40","created":1793189645752,"text":"斑块破裂后为什么容易引起血栓形成？\n结合魏尔啸三要素：血管内皮损伤、\n血流状态异常（血流动力学异常）、\n血液凝固性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpvnxk0","created":1793189719486,"text":"1. 内膜（内皮）损伤","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpwjts0","created":1793189719487,"text":"斑块纤维帽破裂，斑块里面的脂质、胶原、组织因子暴露；\n胶原直接激活血小板，组织因子启动外源性凝血通路，\n是血栓形成最重要始动因素。","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpwlgw0","created":1793189719487,"text":"2. 血流动力学异常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpw69s0","created":1793189719487,"text":"斑块本身造成血管狭窄；\n斑块破裂后局部形成凹凸不平破损面，产生涡流、血流变慢；\n涡流会让血小板更容易和破损内膜黏附聚集。","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpwjrs0","created":1793189719487,"text":"3. 血液凝固性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggpcpwbk80","created":1793189719487,"text":"斑块内大量促凝物质释放，激活血小板与凝血系统；\n血小板活化、凝血因子激活，血液处于高凝状态，快速形成血栓。","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggqdbh6080","created":1793189799156,"text":"动脉瘤","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggql5xz9k0","created":1793189816236,"text":"斑块的长期存在，可以出现钙化；\n而长期压迫导致动脉壁变薄，弹性下降，\n在持续血流的冲击下，可以导致动脉瘤的形成","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3ukzc51s0","created":1793153454864,"text":"重要器官的变化","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggsjn36m80","created":1793189969647,"text":"冠状动脉粥样硬化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggt5d0yow0","created":1793190016928,"text":"•特点：","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggtrcbvsg0","created":1793190064775,"text":"左侧>右侧","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggtrccbnk0","created":1793190064776,"text":"大支>小支","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggtrccj340","created":1793190064776,"text":"近端>远端","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggtu328mg0","created":1793190070745,"text":"分级：根据狭窄程度","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggu5enrtc0","created":1793190095391,"text":"I 级\t    ≦25%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggu5enk9k0","created":1793190095391,"text":"II级\t    26%-50%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggu5enofc0","created":1793190095391,"text":"III级     51%-75%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggu5enzl40","created":1793190095391,"text":"IV级     ≥76%","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggsmbv3s00","created":1793189975499,"text":"冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病（冠心病CHD）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmgguvjrebs0","created":1793190152296,"text":"冠状动脉狭窄、供血不足引起的心肌功能障碍，又称缺血性心脏病","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmgguy7zc340","created":1793190158114,"text":"病因","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggv0f3xe00","created":1793190162898,"text":"冠状动脉供血不足","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggvgzj3ts0","created":1793190198962,"text":"AS所致管腔狭窄","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggvjbnjw80","created":1793190204048,"text":"AS继发病变","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggvloniyg0","created":1793190209188,"text":"冠脉痉挛","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggvdwwjq80","created":1793190192272,"text":"心肌耗氧量剧增","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggvqeour40","created":1793190219469,"text":"情绪激动\n血压骤升\n劳累…","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggvz7w6000","created":1793190238649,"text":"临床表现"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggwemstm00","created":1793190272202,"text":"心绞痛  Angina pectoris  "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggwn5s5uw0","created":1793190290764,"text":"心肌急剧的、暂时性缺血缺氧表现：阵发性胸骨后疼痛"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggwn5ro8w0","created":1793190290764,"text":"疼痛类型：钳夹样、压迫样、放散样"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggxbp4wmg0","created":1793190344177,"text":"心绞痛类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggxes8bkw0","created":1793190350895,"text":"稳定性心绞痛"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggxhk22ao0","created":1793190356931,"text":"最常见，常发生于AS，心功能需求增高时"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggxue70200","created":1793190384875,"text":"不稳定性心绞痛"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggxzn53a80","created":1793190396300,"text":"非阻塞性血栓，休息和劳累时均可出现"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggybcg48g0","created":1793190421774,"text":"变异性心绞痛"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggye8fvg80","created":1793190428062,"text":"冠脉痉挛，常在休息时出现"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggwemshts0","created":1793190272202,"text":"心肌梗死  Myocardial infarction, MI"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmggyo4al940","created":1793190449580,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmggwemt4w00","created":1793190272203,"text":"心肌纤维化 Myocardial Fibrosis"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmggwemt8co0","created":1793190272203,"text":"冠状动脉性猝死 Sudden coronary death"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tnec9y80","created":1793153381761,"text":"高血压病","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tr0bdnk0","created":1793153389620,"text":"风湿病","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmg3tskjn3c0","created":1793153393020,"text":"感染性心内膜炎","layout":null},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}